# Fixed Database Architecture (REV19)

The architecture is LOCKED.

Do not redesign modules.

Each module owns its own Single Source Of Truth (SSOT).

------------------------------------------------

000 Platform

Owns ONLY:

- infrastructure
- auth integration
- RLS helpers
- audit
- logging
- monitoring
- queues
- events
- webhooks
- scheduler
- cron
- vault
- storage
- platform utilities

Never contains business entities.

------------------------------------------------

001 Core Types (Global SSOT)

Owns ONLY:

- enums
- shared domains
- shared SQL types
- lifecycle states
- reusable lookup definitions

No business tables.

------------------------------------------------

002 Core SaaS (SSOT)

Owns:

- tenants
- memberships
- subscriptions
- permissions
- portal identity
- tenant configuration

------------------------------------------------

003 Property & Device Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- properties
- rooms
- devices
- categories
- assignments
- configurations
- device business logic
- device workflows
- device triggers

------------------------------------------------

004 Booking & Lock Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- bookings
- guest access
- lock access
- credentials
- policies
- booking business logic
- booking workflows

------------------------------------------------

005 Integration Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- providers
- provider mappings
- integration state
- provider capabilities

------------------------------------------------

006 Operations Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- workflows
- templates
- operational state

------------------------------------------------

007 Preconfig Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- blueprints
- preconfiguration templates
- bundle mapping

Never stores runtime state.

------------------------------------------------

008 Logistics Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- fulfilment
- warehouse
- shipping
- package definitions
- logistics business logic

------------------------------------------------

009 Commerce Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- plans
- pricing
