- portal configuration
- services
- feature entitlements

------------------------------------------------

011 Onboarding Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- onboarding sessions
- onboarding progress
- onboarding mappings

------------------------------------------------

012 Intelligence Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- recommendations
- scoring
- insights
- optimization

------------------------------------------------

013 Growth Engine (SSOT)

Owns:

- CRM integrations
- campaigns
- conversions
- upsell
- marketing analytics

------------------------------------------------

